    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/e49d78-3/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=623635732535182188&sectionId=623635732619068268)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"gqbfAGjagTtRV_text","label":"gqbfAGjagTtRV_text","default":"<span style=\"font-size:28px;\"><strong>4.9 / 5.0 — Trusted by 1M+ across the AgeAura family</strong></span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggg-tRhWKdi_text","label":"ggg-tRhWKdi_text","default":"<p>In an 800-user survey: 92% reported overall wellness improved within 60 days · 88% better energy &amp; afternoon focus · 87% visible skin, hair &amp; recovery by month 3*</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDIztUNq36_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggDIztUNq36_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://placehold.co/900x1200?text=Image"},{"type":"html","id":"ggi_WirsJML_text","label":"ggi_WirsJML_text","default":"<p>✅ YOLANDA B. ★★★★★</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZQujEgX0W_text","label":"ggZQujEgX0W_text","default":"<p>\"From 6 Minutes To 30 Seconds\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOJMfEaHZu_text","label":"ggOJMfEaHZu_text","default":"<p>I'd been stacking NMN, Urolithin A and collagen from three different brands for over a year. Switching to the Protocol cut my morning ritual from 6 minutes to 30 seconds — and I'm sleeping deeper than I have in years.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0XgNJ89am_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg0XgNJ89am_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://placehold.co/648x864?text=Image"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmugokkcFf_text","label":"ggmugokkcFf_text","default":"<p>✅ JASMINE R., 48 ★★★★★</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gIJVREupyJIuw_text","label":"gIJVREupyJIuw_text","default":"<p>\"Zero Flavor, Real Results\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggfPqh2gBdA_text","label":"ggfPqh2gBdA_text","default":"<p>Two months on Protocol and the morning stiffness is gone. My partner actually commented on my skin. I forget the peptide stick is in my matcha because it has zero flavor.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9qBKd0WvZ_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg9qBKd0WvZ_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://placehold.co/736x1308?text=Image"},{"type":"html","id":"gggpvdvjfjD_text","label":"gggpvdvjfjD_text","default":"<p>✅ Seth T., 56 ★★★★★</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggC0YRHfETw_text","label":"ggC0YRHfETw_text","default":"<p>\"The Missing Piece I Was Already Paying For\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7XhvEi4Cz_text","label":"gg7XhvEi4Cz_text","default":"<p>No more shaker, no more pill organiser, no more 4 separate subscriptions. The Protocol gives me the cellular support I was paying for across four other bottles.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6OP3FvqDL_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg6OP3FvqDL_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://placehold.co/960x1200?text=Image"},{"type":"html","id":"ggK2C27ww49_text","label":"ggK2C27ww49_text","default":"<p>✅ Gary C., 56 ★★★★★</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggw5c7dBUpW_text","label":"ggw5c7dBUpW_text","default":"<p>\"I Finally Threw Out The 8-Bottle Cabinet\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8JF86KfdE_text","label":"gg8JF86KfdE_text","default":"<p>Nine capsules before work — some mornings I just stared at the pile. I stopped everything once and noticed zero difference except the money I saved. Three compounds I can actually explain beats fourteen I couldn't.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXI_4rTl3P_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggXI_4rTl3P_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://placehold.co/1200x1597?text=Image"},{"type":"html","id":"ggFrSZLJwkE_text","label":"ggFrSZLJwkE_text","default":"<p>✅ Alex T., 56 ★★★★★</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaL_NWpooh_text","label":"ggaL_NWpooh_text","default":"<p>\"My Garmin Finally Moved\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQuSqV0nCw_text","label":"ggQuSqV0nCw_text","default":"<p>My VO2 max sat stuck for two years. A few months in, the number's climbing, recovery between hard days is faster, and Urolithin A has ruined my afternoon naps — I just don't need them anymore.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggIWUO5j6KB_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggIWUO5j6KB_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://placehold.co/720x1225?text=Image"},{"type":"html","id":"gggwjmLjrda_text","label":"gggwjmLjrda_text","default":"<p>✅ Katty F., 56 ★★★★★</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbGkTCgH7u_text","label":"ggbGkTCgH7u_text","default":"<p>\"My Husband Noticed Before I Said A Word\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyj40apyno_text","label":"ggyj40apyno_text","default":"<p>At 54 I felt like I was crumbling. Now my nails grow instead of split, my knees are quiet on the stairs, and he told me I was looking well — without me fishing for it. If men notice, it's working.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggA64kZDPk2_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggA64kZDPk2_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://placehold.co/606x923?text=Image"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxIo_rwPyT_text","label":"ggxIo_rwPyT_text","default":"<p>✅ Jason B., 56 ★★★★★</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZ_B050-J8_text","label":"ggZ_B050-J8_text","default":"<p>\"The First Brand That Actually Showed Me The COA\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg84j4dnWYC_text","label":"gg84j4dnWYC_text","default":"<p>If a company won't post a certificate, I don't bother anymore. This one prints every milligram on the label — and it's the first NMN I've taken that included the TMG the others were missing.</p>"}],
